  "prefLabel": "Env-A 3802.03 The Climate Registry",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 3802.03 “The Climate Registry” means the nonprofit organization created to establish consistent, transparent standards throughout North America for businesses and governments to calculate, verify and publicly report their carbon footprints in a single, unified registry.\n\nSource. #9470, eff 5-16-09",
